WEBVTT

1
00:00:01,680 --> 00:00:04,040
Are you willing to honor the deal now?

2
00:00:04,790 --> 00:00:06,350
I will dedicate my strength to the base

3
00:00:06,750 --> 00:00:21,500
You're not hurt, are you? No, thank you just now

4
00:00:21,940 --> 00:00:29,000
There are four purple gold rivers here

5
00:00:29,480 --> 00:00:31,400
There is also a red gold river that I have never seen before

6
00:00:31,600 --> 00:00:34,040
Now there is no way to survive in an all-out war with the authorities.

7
00:00:34,440 --> 00:00:36,080
Those people took everyone away

8
00:00:37,240 --> 00:00:39,930
He will remember today only when he is alive
